(4598156, 663916, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely structure and good choice for the challenge; good use of the diagonal for composition.  The color is a bit blah.  OK, a lot blah.  In cases like this - no decent sky to provide any color for instance and no color per se in your main subject - you may want to try converting to B&amp;W.  Won''t help your vote much (I speak from experience) but may give you a more pleasing photograph.</td>', 'A lovely structure and good choice for the challenge; good use of the diagonal for composition.  The color is a bit blah.  OK, a lot blah.  In cases like this - no decent sky to provide any color for instance and no color per se in your main subject - you may want to try converting to B&W.  Won''t help your vote much (I speak from experience) but may give you a more pleasing photograph.', '2008-03-31 05:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
