(4598729, 663791, 43774, '<td valign="top">I could just scream when I see photos like this!!! (that''s a good thing, in case you were wondering) I want to visit London so badly and will hopefully get there later this year. I just love this photo, the stunning architecture, the beautiful day, the contrast of old and new, how the gleaming rail just pulls me into the photo, perfect!!!</td>', 'I could just scream when I see photos like this!!! (that''s a good thing, in case you were wondering) I want to visit London so badly and will hopefully get there later this year. I just love this photo, the stunning architecture, the beautiful day, the contrast of old and new, how the gleaming rail just pulls me into the photo, perfect!!!', '2008-03-31 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598767, 663574, 43774, '<td valign="top">Oh this is cool! Minimalistic but very appealing, love the contrast, the curves that draw my eye to the center of the photo, well done.</td>', 'Oh this is cool! Minimalistic but very appealing, love the contrast, the curves that draw my eye to the center of the photo, well done.', '2008-03-31 11:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
