(4602819, 663404, 30982, '<td valign="top">The strongest element of this is the diagonal line of the bridge itself, then the sky above it.  There are curves but they aren''t the dominating element here.  If you''d wanted to make the curves stronger (a challenge-related thing, not a photograph thing) you could have cropped different to emphasize that first arch.  I like the quiet bit of the twon underneath - for me it balances very well against the sky in the upper left.</td>', 'The strongest element of this is the diagonal line of the bridge itself, then the sky above it.  There are curves but they aren''t the dominating element here.  If you''d wanted to make the curves stronger (a challenge-related thing, not a photograph thing) you could have cropped different to emphasize that first arch.  I like the quiet bit of the twon underneath - for me it balances very well against the sky in the upper left.', '2008-04-01 14:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4602846, 663791, 30982, '<td valign="top">Where was that sunshine when I was there??  Lovely day.</td>', 'Where was that sunshine when I was there??  Lovely day.', '2008-04-01 14:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603007, 663551, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s a curve and it''s minimal, and it kinda looks like it''s looking at you.  As a picture, it''s not exciting enough to draw a high score.</td>', 'It''s a curve and it''s minimal, and it kinda looks like it''s looking at you.  As a picture, it''s not exciting enough to draw a high score.', '2008-04-01 15:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603014, 663933, 30982, '<td valign="top">Paprika?  Very good clean shot, though there''s some banding going on in the background.  Not sure that it hurts the shot at all, though.</td>', 'Paprika?  Very good clean shot, though there''s some banding going on in the background.  Not sure that it hurts the shot at all, though.', '2008-04-01 15:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603080, 663841, 65468, '<td valign="top">For me the softness of focus in the overall image coupled with the pastel colors create a very pleasing image with the curves of the petals.</td>', 'For me the softness of focus in the overall image coupled with the pastel colors create a very pleasing image with the curves of the petals.', '2008-04-01 16:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4603093, 662818, 65468, '<td valign="top">This image could have worked well for the Patterns III Challenge maybe even more so.  Great DOF, composition and exposure.</td>', 'This image could have worked well for the Patterns III Challenge maybe even more so.  Great DOF, composition and exposure.', '2008-04-01 16:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
