(4609543, 663738, 82985, '<td valign="top">I love this type of image, and this one would have been "best in show" for me if not for the full-frontal-loss-of-focus....  But this is very well seen, composed, lit, and would be worth a reshoot if that is possible.  This is obviously a depth of field challenge (digital-back view camera, anyone?) I wonder if two separate exposures for near and far focus could be merged to accomplish this?  sorry--just thinkin out loud, there....  9</td>', 'I love this type of image, and this one would have been "best in show" for me if not for the full-frontal-loss-of-focus....  But this is very well seen, composed, lit, and would be worth a reshoot if that is possible.  This is obviously a depth of field challenge (digital-back view camera, anyone?) I wonder if two separate exposures for near and far focus could be merged to accomplish this?  sorry--just thinkin out loud, there....  9', '2008-04-03 01:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
