(4616411, 663498, 90495, '<td valign="top">Lovely interior shot. Detail is good in the rafter shadows. Window light has blown out spots but that''s to be expected although they are a bit too bright.</td>', 'Lovely interior shot. Detail is good in the rafter shadows. Window light has blown out spots but that''s to be expected although they are a bit too bright.', '2008-04-05 14:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
