(4617335, 663908, 28261, '<td valign="top">Um...wow.<br/> <br/>This is amazing and it should be on a museum wall.  It makes me feel Wizard of Oz and Flash Gordon and Metropolis all at once.  There is an apocalyptic feel and an overwhelming sense of loss in the softness of the wings against the ''horizon''. -- I''ve given a few ten''s in this challenge.  It''s too bad I can''t give this a 20.  10+Favorite.  Please make this available in print.</td>', 'Um...wow. This is amazing and it should be on a museum wall.  It makes me feel Wizard of Oz and Flash Gordon and Metropolis all at once.  There is an apocalyptic feel and an overwhelming sense of loss in the softness of the wings against the ''horizon''. -- I''ve given a few ten''s in this challenge.  It''s too bad I can''t give this a 20.  10+Favorite.  Please make this available in print.', '2008-04-05 23:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
