(4619955, 663545, 68504, '<td valign="top">Very cunning indeed. I think this appeals to me more than the top few pages I''ve viewed, and NOT just because it is a dog. Title gets at the otherness of this photo.</td>', 'Very cunning indeed. I think this appeals to me more than the top few pages I''ve viewed, and NOT just because it is a dog. Title gets at the otherness of this photo.', '2008-04-07 02:08:58.000000', NULL, 0),
