(4620195, 663908, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657241" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657241.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657241.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657241.jpg"/></a> simple and poignant.  the little tiny curves of the wings for little tiny flights, all done now.</td>', ' simple and poignant.  the little tiny curves of the wings for little tiny flights, all done now.', '2008-04-07 06:10:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4620196, 663822, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657242" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657242.jpg"/></a> the dark and light, the twisting forms, the death and life.  stunning, composition and tones all spot on.  this keeps me warm at night.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-07 05:11:41.</i></td>', ' the dark and light, the twisting forms, the death and life.  stunning, composition and tones all spot on.  this keeps me warm at night.', '2008-04-07 06:11:25.000000', '2008-04-07 06:11:41.000000', 0),
(4620197, 663871, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> shows how much i know - i thought this was really dpc friendly.  the buttery feel of the guitar is just scrummy.  i love the soft, gentle curves; the colours and tones are just superb.</td>', ' shows how much i know - i thought this was really dpc friendly.  the buttery feel of the guitar is just scrummy.  i love the soft, gentle curves; the colours and tones are just superb.', '2008-04-07 06:12:22.000000', NULL, 0),
