(4621841, 662302, 83080, '<td valign="top">I was just scrolling through the ''curves'' results and your image seems a bit misplaced as it''s fairly under rated IMHO.  This is such a fine macro with thoughtful composition, great texture, and sharpness that shows off the veins &amp; little droplets and the curves going in to the interior.  Lighting for some of the outer petals may be a touch harsh, but not in a way that detracts terribly from the overall effect you''ve accomplished.  Keep up the great shooting even if it is under appreciated sometimes.</td>', 'I was just scrolling through the ''curves'' results and your image seems a bit misplaced as it''s fairly under rated IMHO.  This is such a fine macro with thoughtful composition, great texture, and sharpness that shows off the veins & little droplets and the curves going in to the interior.  Lighting for some of the outer petals may be a touch harsh, but not in a way that detracts terribly from the overall effect you''ve accomplished.  Keep up the great shooting even if it is under appreciated sometimes.', '2008-04-07 20:02:59.000000', NULL, 0),
