(4629665, 662605, 67697, '<td valign="top">I wanted to comment on this during the challenge but I ran out of time.  I love how the petals seem to be reaching thru the picture.  This has such a lovely victorian quality to it.  Beautiful!</td>', 'I wanted to comment on this during the challenge but I ran out of time.  I love how the petals seem to be reaching thru the picture.  This has such a lovely victorian quality to it.  Beautiful!', '2008-04-10 09:58:30.000000', NULL, 0),
