(4634078, 663208, 7743, '<td valign="top">*** Critique Club ***<br/> <br/>First impressions: There''s a sense of strength here.  The diagonal placement of the main subject helps with that.<br/> <br/>Composition: Choice of angle for this shot I think works very well.  It might even be improved if the main subject were placed at a steeper diagonal.<br/> <br/>Exposure: For the most part the exposure seems pretty good though there is a bright spot in the lower left which draws the eye away from more interesting areas of the image.<br/> <br/>Impact: I think the impact is drawn from the repeating patterns and use of the diagonal.<br/> <br/>Keep shooting.<br/> <br/>Cheers!<br/> <br/>Colette</td>', '*** Critique Club *** First impressions: There''s a sense of strength here.  The diagonal placement of the main subject helps with that. Composition: Choice of angle for this shot I think works very well.  It might even be improved if the main subject were placed at a steeper diagonal. Exposure: For the most part the exposure seems pretty good though there is a bright spot in the lower left which draws the eye away from more interesting areas of the image. Impact: I think the impact is drawn from the repeating patterns and use of the diagonal. Keep shooting. Cheers! Colette', '2008-04-11 21:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
