(4635384, 663908, 61651, '<td valign="top">You are a lucky, lucky man to be surrounded by such opportune detritus, and a smart one to take the opportunity seriously.  I like the subtlety of these curves - too many times the assumption is that the challenge topic must only be expressed in a large and obvious way, to be successful.  A very emotive image, with an air of eulogy.  I regret not voting for this challenge.</td>', 'You are a lucky, lucky man to be surrounded by such opportune detritus, and a smart one to take the opportunity seriously.  I like the subtlety of these curves - too many times the assumption is that the challenge topic must only be expressed in a large and obvious way, to be successful.  A very emotive image, with an air of eulogy.  I regret not voting for this challenge.', '2008-04-12 19:25:11.000000', NULL, 0),
