(4654880, 663614, 77192, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SoulMan1978:</b></div><hr/><i> I''ve done this before, and I think yours was better than mine. Well done :-)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=617334" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/778/120/617334.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/778/120/617334.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/778/120/617334.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh its YOU lol. Great shot - No wonder it''s better than mine - you''re the queen of shots like this :-) in fact one of your shots gave me the inspiration in the first place.<br/> <br/>Nice work on a great shot and a belated thanks for the inspiration.</td>', 'Originally posted by SoulMan1978: I''ve done this before, and I think yours was better than mine. Well done :-)    Oh its YOU lol. Great shot - No wonder it''s better than mine - you''re the queen of shots like this :-) in fact one of your shots gave me the inspiration in the first place. Nice work on a great shot and a belated thanks for the inspiration.', '2008-04-23 08:45:25.000000', NULL, 0),
