(5659596, 662126, 99256, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  The lighting and exposure is great.  I love the trees and mountains in the background which complement the very interesting curves of the snow and water.  Good job.</td>', 'I really like this one.  The lighting and exposure is great.  I love the trees and mountains in the background which complement the very interesting curves of the snow and water.  Good job.', '2009-09-23 16:48:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5731893, 663352, 37845, '<td valign="top">Hey Leo, this does look familiar :)<br/> <br/>I like your shot a lot better though. You taught me something the first time we met up, and that was the ''Human Element''. That is the strength of this shot.</td>', 'Hey Leo, this does look familiar :) I like your shot a lot better though. You taught me something the first time we met up, and that was the ''Human Element''. That is the strength of this shot.', '2009-11-18 07:36:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5783156, 663927, 88136, '<td valign="top">wow! very cool</td>', 'wow! very cool', '2009-12-27 22:20:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5981637, 663169, 79955, '<td valign="top">I just found this and this is such an amazing shot !!!! WOW , love it !!</td>', 'I just found this and this is such an amazing shot !!!! WOW , love it !!', '2010-04-30 21:54:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6103452, 663839, 1232, '<td valign="top">beutiful.. :)</td>', 'beutiful.. :)', '2010-07-25 15:33:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6110109, 663169, 40718, '<td valign="top">This shot is much better.  You leave some negative space for us.  I''m trying to decide whether you burned the black areas or whether they are dark in the original.  It looks somewhat artificial, probably because the bird is so bright along with the reflection of the circles in the water.  Again, I think you need to up your shutter speed just a bit. 1/500 would have been much better as I sense just a tad of either motion blur or camera blur.</td>', 'This shot is much better.  You leave some negative space for us.  I''m trying to decide whether you burned the black areas or whether they are dark in the original.  It looks somewhat artificial, probably because the bird is so bright along with the reflection of the circles in the water.  Again, I think you need to up your shutter speed just a bit. 1/500 would have been much better as I sense just a tad of either motion blur or camera blur.', '2010-07-31 01:12:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(6928033, 663905, 104009, '<td valign="top">THE WAY THERE SEEMS TO BE AN INNER BLACK RING JUST GIVES THIS ADDED DIMENSION AND 3D FEEL, VERY NICE</td>', 'THE WAY THERE SEEMS TO BE AN INNER BLACK RING JUST GIVES THIS ADDED DIMENSION AND 3D FEEL, VERY NICE', '2012-12-09 08:47:14.000000', NULL, 0),
